# d3d11_classlink_probe: winoracle (WARP, 10.0.26100) x64 output, every case
# in its own process (d3d11_classlink_run.cmd). Identical over five x64 runs
# but one, in which WARP removed the device (0x887a0020 DXGI_ERROR_DRIVER_
# INTERNAL_ERROR) at multi_b's CSSetShader; some cs_multi sets not used here
# do so every time. The x86 build matches except where SampOp samples through
# this[].z/.w (multi_b, dyn_2_sel0, draw_vs_ps_res): x86 WARP reads 0 from
# that texture on some runs; x64 returns the texel, as the spec says.
